@prefix skosdex: <https://danbri.org/ns/skosdex#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix rdf:     <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .

# CABT — CAB Thesaurus (CABI), the agriculture / applied-life-sciences subject
# thesaurus used to index CAB Abstracts. ~136,900 terms (98,500 preferred,
# 38,400 non-preferred) under the http://id.cabi.org/cabt namespace; a relevant
# mapping target for our corpus (sits alongside AGROVOC / NALT / GEMET).
#
# *** METADATA-ONLY (bundle false): NO free bulk SKOS dump is available. ***
# Verified 2026-06-11; what was found:
#   - CABI's own bulk download at id.cabi.org is auth-walled (HTTP 401/403); no
#     anonymous full-dump endpoint.
#   - CABI's product page (https://www.cabidigitallibrary.org/cabi-thesaurus)
#     and the FAO/AIMS release note
#     (https://aims.fao.org/news/new-edition-cab-thesaurus-published) both state
#     the SKOS/RDF "full thesaurus files are available in several formats ON
#     REQUEST" (contact the CABI Thesaurus Manager) — i.e. not an open download.
#   - AgroPortal hosts it (http://agroportal.lirmm.fr/ontologies/CABT, now
#     https://agroportal.eu/ontologies/CABT) but the submission is access-
#     restricted: the REST API and /download endpoint return HTTP 401/403 even
#     with AgroPortal's public test API key, and the metadata/download pages
#     require login. So AgroPortal is NOT a free bulk source for CABT either.
#   No fabricated sourceURL is recorded; there is no fetchable open dump.
#
# License: CC BY-NC-ND 3.0 — http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/3.0/
# (per BARTOC's record of the publisher's terms, https://bartoc.org/en/node/211,
# "freely available", license CC BY-NC-ND 3.0). NonCommercial + NoDerivatives ->
# licenseClass "noncommercial". Under skosdex policy v2 this would be
# container-only AND only if the data could be obtained under its own terms —
# but since no free bulk dump exists, this scheme stays metadata-only regardless.
# (NoDerivatives also sits awkwardly with bundling even syntax-normalized data;
# obtain and bundle only after a direct licensing arrangement with CABI.)
<#scheme> a skosdex:Scheme ;
    dcterms:title "CAB Thesaurus (CABI)" ;
    dcterms:publisher <https://www.cabi.org/> ;
    skosdex:conceptSchemeURI <http://id.cabi.org/cabt> ;
    # No open sourceURL: CABI bulk download is auth-walled and AgroPortal's
    # CABT submission is access-restricted (see header). Data is available only
    # on request / under a CABI licensing arrangement.
    skosdex:sourceFormat "application/rdf+xml" ;
    dcterms:license <http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/3.0/> ;
    skosdex:licenseClass "noncommercial" ;
    skosdex:bundle false .
